1~\text{s}\] <strong>(iii) At \(t=\infty\) / steady state</strong><br/>In steady state, the inductor behaves as a short circuit. <img src="img/caf7eb988dbcf2d9.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" style="width:min(100%,256px)"> Applying KCL at node \(A\), \[\frac{V_A}{1}
